      "widgets_values": [
        "We are using quantized weights in this workflow, the original Z-Image-Turbo Model repo is [here](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/tree/main/split_files/diffusion_models)\n\n\n## Model links\n\n**Clip**\n\n- [Qwen3-4B-UD-Q5_K_XL.gguf](https://huggingface.co/jayn7/Z-Image-Turbo-GGUF/tree/main)\n\n**Diffusion models**\n\n- [Jib Mix Zit model](https://civitai.com/models/2231351/jib-mix-zit)\n\n**VAE**\n\n- [UltraFlux-v1](https://huggingface.co/Owen777/UltraFlux-v1/tree/main/vae​)\n\n\n**Upscale Model**\n\n- [2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp.pth](https://huggingface.co/Thelocallab/2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp/blob/main/2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp.pth)\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │      └── Qwen3-4B-UD-Q5_K_XL.gguf\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_model/\n│   │      └── JibMixZit.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── UltraFlux-v1.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 upscale_models/\n│          └── 2xLexicaRRDBNet_Sharp.pth\n```\n"
